      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "author": "Asha Moreno <asha.moreno@harborviewexpo.org>",
      "subject": "Blue Lantern intake: read this before you touch anything",
      "shortSummary": "Asha sends the first Harborview reports and asks you to identify what connects them.",
      "date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00",
      "body": "{player},\n\nHarborview Expo opens in eighteen hours. Four reports arrived before sunrise:\n- An SMS from HV-Badge says staff must revalidate their LanternPass badges.\n- A caller claims to be mobile support.\n- A cloned help desk profile is answering staff.\n- A QR sticker appeared near West Gate registration.\n\nEach report contains the marker BL-LANTERN-9. Treat it as a lead connecting the reports, preserve the original evidence, and never test a lure with real credentials. The staff being targeted are not at fault.\n\nAsha",
      "attachements": []
    }
  ]
}
